<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">MY CAMPUS LAB</view><view class="page-title">我的实验室</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{user}}"><view class="card profile-heading"><view class="profile-initial">{{user.can_book_room ? '教' : '学'}}</view><view><view class="card-title">{{user.display_name}}</view><view class="card-meta">{{roleLabel}}</view><text class="chip green top-gap">{{user.can_book_room ? '设备 + 场地预约' : '设备预约'}}</text></view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{overdue}}">你有逾期未结束的使用记录，请先联系管理员办理结束。</view><view class="section-label">预约额度</view><view class="card"><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">未来设备预约</text><text class="kv-value">{{stats.future_equipment}} / {{policy.equipment_quota}} 项</text></view><view class="kv" wx:if="{{user.can_book_room}}"><text class="kv-key">未来场地预约</text><text class="kv-value">{{stats.future_room}} / {{policy.room_quota}} 项</text></view><view class="hint">待审核与已确认的未来申请共同计入额度，两类分别计数。</view></view><view class="section-label">我的培训资格</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{qualifications}}" wx:key="code" class="qualification-item"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="chip {{item.valid ? 'green' : 'red'}}">{{item.valid ? '当前有效' : '当前无效'}}</text></view><view class="hint">有效期：{{item.expiry_label}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!qualifications.length}}" class="small-copy">暂无专项培训资格；普通设备仍可按预约规则申请。</view><view class="hint">当前有效不代表覆盖未来预约，提交与批准时会核对整个预约时段。资格由授权人员维护。</view></view><view class="section-label">使用约定</view><view class="card"><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">可预约范围</text><text class="kv-value">未来 {{policy.window_days}} 天</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">时间单位</text><text class="kv-value">{{policy.slot_minutes}} 分钟</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">单次最长</text><text class="kv-value">{{policy.max_hours}} 小时</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">同时借设备</text><text class="kv-value">最多 {{policy.simultaneous_equipment}} 台或套</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="small-copy">本项目使用模拟业务、身份和消息数据。审批、实物交接及维修处理由网页管理端完成。</view></view></view><button class="secondary top-gap" bindtap="signout" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">退出并切换账号</button><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在更新个人信息…</view></view>
